(load "carp-physics-3d.carp")

(Project.config "title" "carp-physics-3d")
(Project.config "docs-directory" "./docs/")
(Project.config "docs-logo" "")
(Project.config "docs-url" "https://github.com/carpentry-org/carp-physics-3d")
(Project.config "docs-styling" "../style.css")
(Project.config "docs-prelude" "A 3D rigid-body physics suite for Carp.

```
(load \"git@github.com:carpentry-org/carp-physics-3d@master\")
```

Transforms and quaternions come from
[carp-math](https://github.com/carpentry-org/carp-math), and handles from
[carp-collections](https://github.com/carpentry-org/carp-collections); both are
pulled in for you.

### Shapes
- [`Geometry`](./Geometry.html) — shapes and their support functions, with
  [`Plane`](./Plane.html) and [`SDF`](./SDF.html)
- [`SpatialGrid`](./SpatialGrid.html) — uniform grid for broad-phase pruning

### Collision
- [`Collision`](./Collision.html) — narrow phase, producing
  [`Contact`](./Contact.html)s and a [`ContactSet`](./ContactSet.html)
- [`CollisionResult`](./CollisionResult.html),
  [`CollisionChecker`](./CollisionChecker.html) — the result and dispatch types

### Simulation
- [`Body`](./Body.html) — mass, velocity and the state that integrates
- [`Integrator`](./Integrator.html) — stepping that state forward
- [`RigidBody`](./RigidBody.html) — a body with a shape and a transform
- [`Solver`](./Solver.html) — the constraint solver that ties it together")

(save-docs Plane
           Contact
           SDF
           ContactSet
           Geometry
           SpatialGrid
           Collision
           CollisionResult
           CollisionChecker
           Body
           Integrator
           RigidBody
           Solver)
; Carp's save-docs hardcodes the index filename as <title>_index.html.
; Rename to docs/index.html.
(defn main []
  (System.system "mv ./docs/carp-physics-3d_index.html ./docs/index.html"))
